ing our guidance for next year and continue to expect to be in this range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/aercap-holdings-aer-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"AER 2018 Q3","e":"aer","d":"2018-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Vincent Caintic","x":"So first, appreciate you reaffirming the guidance for next year x gain from the sale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/aercap-holdings-aer-q3-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"AER 2018 Q4","e":"aer","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Juhas","x":"This was mainly due to a reduction in our headcount and our compensation-related expenses, including to our stock-based compensation expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/aercap-holdings-nv-aer-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"AER 2018 Q4","e":"aer","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Juhas","x":"We had an office, a very small office in Fort Lauderdale that we closed last year and combine that in with our Los Angeles office, and that was really the -- where a majority of that headcount reduction, we are talking about 15 people or so here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/aercap-holdings-nv-aer-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"AER 2019 Q2","e":"aer","d":"2019-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Aengus Kelly","x":"We've increased the outlook for the full year and we'll continue to run this business in a way that's focused on the future and generate the maximum value of our shareholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/30/aercap-holdings-nv-aer-q2-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AER 2020 Q1","e":"aer","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Aengus Kelly","x":"We've done it with a Norwegian airlines as part of the restructuring of that airline as its business plan changed and the government of Norway 